{
  "title": "{ip:Parlo} italiano e {ip:vivo} a Roma",
  "translation": "I speak Italian and I live in Rome",
  "topics": "The present tense: regular verbs in -are, -ere, -ire and fare, andare, stare",
  "grammar": {
    "explain": [
      "Italian verbs are divided into three groups by the ending of the infinitive. Take off *-are, -ere* or *-ire* and add the endings of the present tense.",
      {
        "table": {
          "head": [
            "",
            "parlare (speak)",
            "vivere (live)",
            "dormire (sleep)",
            "capire (understand)"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "io",
              "{ip:parl**o**}",
              "{ip:viv**o**}",
              "{ip:dorm**o**}",
              "{ip:cap**isco**}"
            ],
            [
              "tu",
              "{ip:parl**i**}",
              "{ip:viv**i**}",
              "{ip:dorm**i**}",
              "{ip:cap**isci**}"
            ],
            [
              "lui / lei",
              "{ip:parl**a**}",
              "{ip:viv**e**}",
              "{ip:dorm**e**}",
              "{ip:cap**isce**}"
            ],
            [
              "noi",
              "{ip:parl**iamo**}",
              "{ip:viv**iamo**}",
              "{ip:dorm**iamo**}",
              "{ip:cap**iamo**}"
            ],
            [
              "voi",
              "{ip:parl**ate**}",
              "{ip:viv**ete**}",
              "{ip:dorm**ite**}",
              "{ip:cap**ite**}"
            ],
            [
              "loro",
              "{ip:parl**ano**}",
              "{ip:viv**ono**}",
              "{ip:dorm**ono**}",
              "{ip:cap**iscono**}"
            ]
          ]
        }
      },
      "Some verbs in -ire, like *capire* and *finire*, add *-isc-* in every form except *noi* and *voi*.",
      "These common verbs are irregular and must be learned by heart.",
      {
        "table": {
          "head": [
            "",
            "fare (do, make)",
            "andare (go)",
            "stare (stay, be)"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "io",
              "{ip:faccio}",
              "{ip:vado}",
              "{ip:sto}"
            ],
            [
              "tu",
              "{ip:fai}",
              "{ip:vai}",
              "{ip:stai}"
            ],
            [
              "lui / lei",
              "{ip:fa}",
              "{ip:va}",
              "{ip:sta}"
            ],
            [
              "noi",
              "{ip:facciamo}",
              "{ip:andiamo}",
              "{ip:stiamo}"
            ],
            [
              "voi",
              "{ip:fate}",
              "{ip:andate}",
              "{ip:state}"
            ],
            [
              "loro",
              "{ip:fanno}",
              "{ip:vanno}",
              "{ip:stanno}"
            ]
          ]
        }
      },
      "The present also describes plans: *Domani lavoro* (I'm working tomorrow). And remember: *Come {ip:stai}?* means *How are you?*"
    ]
  },
  "use": {
    "exercises": [
      {
        "type": "gap",
        "prompt": "Put the verb in the present tense.",
        "questions": [
          "Io [[parlo#ip]] italiano. (parlare)",
          "Tu [[vivi#ip]] a Roma? (vivere)",
          "Marco [[dorme#ip]] molto. (dormire)",
          "Noi [[lavoriamo#ip]] in centro. (lavorare)",
          "Voi [[leggete#ip]] un libro. (leggere)",
          "Loro [[mangiano#ip]] la pizza. (mangiare)",
          "Io non [[capisco#ip]]. (capire)"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "choice",
        "prompt": "Choose the right form.",
        "questions": [
          {
            "q": "Io ___ al mercato. (andare)",
            "options": [
              "*{ip:vado}",
              "{ip:va}",
              "{ip:vai}"
            ]
          },
          {
            "q": "Che cosa ___ tu? (fare)",
            "options": [
              "{ip:fa}",
              "*{ip:fai}",
              "{ip:fate}"
            ]
          },
          {
            "q": "Come ___ Anna? (stare)",
            "options": [
              "{ip:stai}",
              "*{ip:sta}",
              "{ip:stanno}"
            ]
          },
          {
            "q": "Noi ___ a scuola. (andare)",
            "options": [
              "{ip:andate}",
              "{ip:vanno}",
              "*{ip:andiamo}"
            ]
          },
          {
            "q": "Loro ___ colazione. (fare)",
            "options": [
              "*{ip:fanno}",
              "{ip:fa}",
              "{ip:fate}"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
